Date: Fri, 4 Sep 2026 21:49:08 +0330
Subject: [PATCH] feat(browser): per-site permissions for camera, microphone
 and location

- SitePermissionsStore: per-origin Ask/Allow/Block decisions behind a
  document seam (JVM-tested); private tabs never use stored decisions
- WebChromeClient handles camera + microphone capture requests together,
  honours remembered blocks silently, offers allow/deny/always-deny
- Geolocation prompt with the same policy; OS runtime permissions for
  RECORD_AUDIO and ACCESS_FINE_LOCATION requested on demand
- Browser menu shows stored decisions with tap-to-reset
